cademy VR facilitates learning and the updating of technical knowledge. This tool is exclusive for members associated with workshop networks that are subscribed to the ServiceNext platform, providing a direct path towards excellence and innovation in automotive service.", "short_description": "Dive into the future of automotive training with Next Academy VR. Learn about hybrid and electric vehicles through immersive 360\u00ba experiences, exclusively designed for mechanics and workshops subscribed to ServiceNext."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://servicenext.eu/policy-vr", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Service Next Automotive Technology SL", "support_website_url": "https://www.servicenext.eu/", "website_url": "https://www.servicenext.eu/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": null, "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en", "fr", "pt", "es", "nl"], "supported_input_devices": ["GAMEPAD", "OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "7661959073927497"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39031344_1777991439350460_6416894580631473890_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=kbsJ-kXsgzYQ7kNvwGG3DSd&_nc_oc=AdnNpmkxSrNWRf46SMvj4IEBeU6P8h5XNeW9YoyxbOnIgLrpLPHTwWuHl5rYUFxRvuw&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ams2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=8&oh=00_AfztOdFaG-y_E_XLM2NJlcrdJmgW9XmtUzmI1DTfsC-5ZQ&oe=69AED94F"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial